#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/0e231d46-e185-42c7-a7f6-33b784f4a8f2-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"At the start, Alice has an unknown quantum state $|\\psi \\rangle.$ We will "
"create this using the $U$ gate.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-outputs/6625f333-131f-4ecb-"
"ae09-c256d6589a61-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We can visualize the state we've created, but only because we know what "
"parameters were used in the $U$ gate. If this state had emerged from a "
"complicated quantum process, the state would not be knowable without running"
" the process to create the state many times, and collecting statistics as in"
" tomography.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/7e13315a-cc23-4068-96f8-742edfe9b43f-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Before this protocol even begins, we assume Alice and Bob have a shared "
"entangled pair. If Alice and Bob are truly in different locations, they "
"might have set up the shared state *before* the unknown state "
"$|\\psi\\rangle$ was ever created. Because those things are happening on "
"different qubits, there order here won't matter, and this order is "
"convenient for visualization.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/965285c8-de03-4649-8c86-e40730dd7977-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Next, Alice entangles $|\\psi \\rangle$ with her part of the shared e-bit, "
"using the $CX$ gate and $H$ gate, and measures them in the computational "
"basis.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/ef9bf28c-24de-47dd-9855-546c69239a09-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Alice sends Bob her measurement results (either “00”, “01”, “10”, or “11”), "
"and Bob performs a correction operator based on Alice’s two bits of "
"information on his part of the shared e-bit. Then, Bob's becomes $|\\psi "
"\\rangle$.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![Output of the previous code cell](/learning/images/courses/utility-scale-"
"quantum-computing/teleportation/extracted-"
"outputs/65c88c15-bf2c-4673-a404-9569f5eefc5d-0.avif)\n"
msgstr ""

