#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "6. Summary {#6-summary}"
msgstr ""

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"In this session, we have implemented two quantum protocols. Although the "
"scenarios for both involving distant friends are somewhat removed from "
"quantum computing on a single QPU, they have applications in quantum "
"computing, and help us understand the transfer of quantum information "
"better.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Quantum teleportation**: Although we cannot copy quantum states, we can "
"teleport unknown quantum states by having shared entanglement.\n"
msgstr ""

#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"**Quantum superdense coding**: A shared entangled pair, and transfer of one "
"qubit, enable the communication of two bits of classical information.\n"
msgstr ""
